- The class should include a method `close_session` that takes a session ID as an argument and removes the session from the dictionary.
- Implement a method `read_message` that takes a session ID as an argument and returns the message read from the session using the `visalib` library. If an error occurs during the read operation, return "Error reading message" as the reply.
- Implement a method `write_message` that takes a session ID and a message as arguments and writes the message to the session using the `visalib` library. Return the length of the message written and a status code indicating success or failure.

