```

For example, given the following JSON file named `languages.json`:
```json
{
  "languages": [
    {
      "name": "C",
      "year": 1972,
      "paradigm": ["procedural"]
    },
    {
      "name": "Haskell",
      "year": 1990,
      "paradigm": ["functional"]
    },
    {
      "name": "Python",
      "year": 1991,
      "paradigm": ["object-oriented", "imperative", "functional"]
    }
  ]
